### Obtener imágenes de una unidad — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/getImages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/getImages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1
}

### UnitId inválido (0) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/getImages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 0
}

### Sin unitId (campo requerido faltante) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/getImages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### Unidad inexistente (lista vacía, count 0) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/getImages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 999999999
}
